OL,3,GNEWSABurrows offers to work with fellow
OL,4,Aunionists in Westminster poll
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Ulster Unionist leader, Jon
OL,7,FBurrows, has offered to work with other
OL,8,Funionist parties in general elections
OL,9,Fsaying "I commit to playing our part in
OL,10,Fexpanding unionist representation at
OL,11,FWestminster".
OL,13,FThe former police officer took over as
OL,14,Fparty leader at the start of this year,
OL,15,Fafter being co-opted to Stormont as an
OL,16,Fassembly member (MLA) last summer.
OL,18,FBurrows was replying to a call from the
OL,19,FDUP leader Gavin Robinson who last week
OL,20,Furged other unionist parties to
OL,21,Fmaximise cooperation in next years
OL,22,Fassembly election.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,413,410,260,120,0,100
