OL,3,GNEWSABurrows offers to work with fellow
OL,4,Aunionists in Westminster poll
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut speaking at his own party
OL,7,Fconference Burrows concentrated instead
OL,8,Fon the next Westminster election, which
OL,9,Funlike the Stormont poll, is run on a
OL,10,Ffirst past the post basis.
